<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>제출 완료</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif; background: #f5f5f4; margin: 0; padding: 24px 16px; }
    .card { max-width: 480px; margin: 60px auto 0; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e5e3; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; }
    h1 { font-size: 18px; margin: 12px 0 8px; }
    p { font-size: 14px; color: #55534f; line-height: 1.6; }
    .check { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e3f2e9; color: #1c6b45; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 22px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="check">✓</div>
    <h1><%= store.name %> 서류 제출이 완료됐습니다</h1>
    <p>5개 서류가 모두 준비되어 담당자에게 전달됐어요.<br />NHN 심사 요청 후 결과가 나오면 안내드릴게요.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
